# The Dockerfile only needs docker-entrypoint.sh and security-floor.py from
# the build context; the rest of the build inputs come from PyPI, from the
# RISE riscv64 wheel index, and from the official AMD64 image. Keeping the
# context minimal avoids sending the working directory to the daemon on every
# build.
*
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!security-floor.py
